warning[if_not_else]: `if !ready` is negated, with an `else`
  --> tests/lint/if_not_else/bad.jai:8:5
   |
 8 |     if !ready {
   |     ^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: test `ready` first and swap the branches
   |
 8 ~     if ready {
 9 ~         print("going\n");
10 ~     } else {
11 ~         print("waiting\n");
12 ~     }
   |

