   |
20 |     if !(a > b && ready) print("x\n");
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: test `a > b && ready` first and swap the branches

warning[if_not_else]: `ifx !ready` is negated, with an `else`
  --> tests/lint/if_not_else/bad.jai:23:14
   |
23 |     label := ifx !ready then "wait" else "go";
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: test `ready` first and swap the branches
